          "char_fang_yuan",
          "gu_creative_thinking_gu",
          "gu_intelligent_heart_gu",
          "gu_tactful_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "On the battle stage in Shang clan city, Wei Yang says Rainbow Light Gu is so fast the Gu Master cannot react in time, and that using it requires lightning thoughts Gu, Flash of Inspiration Gu, or others, or the user may fly too far and crash into a wall.",
        "chapters": [
          266
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "rainbow-light-support",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
