          "sys_gu_master",
          "gu_flash_of_inspiration_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Wei Yang teaches that Gu Masters who like to plot can collect thinking-assist type Gu worms, naming lightning thoughts Gu and immortal showing the way Gu as examples.",
